Maven Build Tool : 

1..maven is a build and dependency manage tool which can be used to create and deploy java projects.
2..we can use Maven to build management and dependenecy management.

1.Build Management :
 Build management is the process of converting java code into final executable or deployable application by performing the following 
 	compiling
 	testing
 	packaging

2.Dependency Management : 
  It is the process of automatically downloading the required jar files(libraries) required by the java application.
  
  Dependency :
  A dependency is a jar file(external library) which the java application need to perform a task.
    
groupId :Identifies the organisation.
artifactId : Name of the project.
vesion : specifies the project version.

